            "review_title": "Review at Wok To Box",
            "review_text": "Emmanuel S\nHanoi, Vietnam917 contributions\n2\nDecent fast food style Asian noodles\nMay 2023 • Solo\nOrdered in home from here. It's a fast food-style version of Asian noodles. The noodles are good. You get to choose the sauce, meat, and vegetables you want. The price is very reasonable. The pack the noodles very well. Try it out if you are seeking something quick and economical.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 10, 2023",
