            "review_title": "Review at Wok To Box",
            "review_text": "Tungnguyen.dn\nDa Nang, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nFancy and Friendly takeaway Restaurant\nJul 2020 • Solo\nOne of the most delicious takeaway restaurant in Hanoi. Friendly and young restaurant, especially the owner and chefs. They have a flexible menu to simply customise my favourite dish. I have ordered a seafood red noodle with park choi and mushroom. I dont know exactly what is their secret sauce, but I really love it, a little bit spicy and sour as tamarind.\nAnw, I think this restaurant is the best choice for students, officers and backpack travellers, or for whom want a big lunch not only healthy and organic but also quickly.\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2020",
